WEBVTT

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:05.250
Why this is becoming a bigger problem. The problem is that if there's unanimity,

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:09.570
then one country has the ability to prevent action from being taken. The

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:14.370
majority of countries in the EU may agree on something, but if just one does not,

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:18.623
then no action will be taken. This isn't just an idea either.
